		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-482ecd9a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="482ecd9a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4cbb6259 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4cbb6259" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7c2680b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7c2680b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The beauty niche <span class="hl">that has to market to two different people</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-43f9966f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="43f9966f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-25371e95 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="25371e95" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1691c122 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1691c122" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A meaningful share of every day spa&#8217;s bookings — often around a third — come from a gift voucher, meaning the marketing target isn&#8217;t the person on the massage table at all. It&#8217;s the partner, friend, or company buying it for them. That&#8217;s a completely different search intent, ad creative and landing page from a self-booking guest, and most spas run one generic campaign for both.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-126f548d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="126f548d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Demand is genuinely predictable — and most spas don't plan around it</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6e34c8bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6e34c8bf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Eid, Mother&#8217;s Day, Valentine&#8217;s Day and summer daycation season create real, repeatable demand spikes in the UAE spa market. Campaigns that ramp two to three weeks ahead of each occasion consistently outperform flat, always-on spend that ignores the calendar entirely.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-33238b2d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="33238b2d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Hammam and traditional treatments are a genuine local differentiator</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-31a9929 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="31a9929" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Traditional Moroccan hammam and regional bath rituals appeal strongly to both UAE residents and the tourist market, yet most spa marketing defaults to generic Western spa imagery and language that undersells this genuinely distinctive offering.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6d97fdc8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="6d97fdc8" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-536fbc61 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="536fbc61" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Day spas, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">~35%</b><span>of bookings typically come from gift vouchers</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">4 occasions</b><span>— Eid, Mother&#8217;s Day, summer, birthdays — drive predictable spikes</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">2 buyers</b><span>— the gifter and the guest need separate campaigns</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Hammam</b><span>— a real, underused regional differentiator</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
