le</div><div style="padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E6EC;color:#D23F63;font-weight:700">Generic spa language</div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr;font-size:13.5px;background:#fff"><div style="padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E6EC;color:#0E0D12">Reporting</div><div style="padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E6EC;color:#0BA05F;font-weight:700">Bookings &amp; voucher sales</div><div style="padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E6EC;color:#D23F63;font-weight:700">Clicks &amp; impressions</div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr;font-size:13.5px;background:#FBFAFE"><div style="padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E6EC;color:#0E0D12">Contract lock-in</div><div style="padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E6EC;color:#0BA05F;font-weight:700">None — monthly rolling</div><div style="padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E6EC;color:#D23F63;font-weight:700">6–12 months</div></div>								</div>
