														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">What does "marketing to the gifter" actually mean in practice?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-4141" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-4141"><p>It means building separate ad creative, headlines and landing pages aimed at someone buying a spa experience for another person — different intent, different messaging, and usually converts on a purchasable voucher page rather than a booking calendar.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
