														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Do occasion-timed campaigns really outperform always-on ads?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-4142" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-4142"><p>In our experience, yes — Eid, Mother&#8217;s Day, Valentine&#8217;s Day and summer daycation season create genuine, repeatable demand spikes in the UAE, and campaigns that ramp two to three weeks ahead consistently outperform flat spend.</p></div>
				</div>
